bcm4360 — Broadcom BCM4360 Wi-Fi driver for Linux

Everything in this repository is distributed under the ISC license below.

src/ derives from the Linux portion of Broadcom's 802.11 Linux STA hybrid
driver 6.30.223.271, which Broadcom released under this same license, with
kernel-compatibility changes by the broadcom-wl contributors (as packaged by
Arch Linux) and further changes by the bcm4360 contributors.

